{"title": "Karsus' Compulsion", "pageid": 14474, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Karsus'_Compulsion", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 9 Spells", "Enchantment spells", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Karsus%27_Compulsion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Karsus%27_Compulsion.webp/300px-Karsus%27_Compulsion.webp, /w/images/4/48/Karsus%27_Compulsion.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Karsus%27_Compulsion.webp/300px-Karsus%27_Compulsion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Karsus%27_Compulsion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Karsus' Compulsion </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 9 enchantment spell</a>. It is granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\">Triune Netherstone</a> and is usable only by <a href=\"/wiki/Full-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Illithid\">Full-Illithids</a> to control the <a href=\"/wiki/Crown_of_Karsus\" title=\"Crown of Karsus\">Crown of Karsus</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Channel the stones' magic to control the Crown of Karsus and dominate the <a href=\"/wiki/Netherbrain\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Netherbrain\">Netherbrain</a>.\n</p><p>The caster must <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Channelling_Karsus%27_Compulsion_(Condition)\" title=\"Channelling Karsus' Compulsion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"channel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channelling_Karsus%27_Compulsion_(Condition)\" title=\"Channelling Karsus' Compulsion (Condition)\">channel</a> this spell until their next turn for it to take effect. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Ends if caster is <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\">Stunned</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a>.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 6 m (20 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 6 m (20 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_END_Mindflayer_CrownDomination</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_END_Mindflayer_CrownDomination\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_END_Mindflayer_CrownDomination\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Wildshape_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wildshape (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">Wildshape</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Channelling_Karsus.27_Compulsion\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Channelling_Karsus'_Compulsion\"> Condition: Channelling Karsus' Compulsion </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Channelling_Karsus%27_Compulsion_(Condition)\" title=\"Channelling Karsus' Compulsion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Channelling Karsus' Compulsion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Channelling_Karsus%27_Compulsion_(Condition)\" title=\"Channelling Karsus' Compulsion (Condition)\">Channelling Karsus' Compulsion</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity is focussing all their magic and effort on casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karsus%27_Compulsion\" title=\"Karsus' Compulsion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/38px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/50px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karsus' Compulsion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp/25px-Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Karsus%27_Compulsion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Karsus' Compulsion</a> until their next turn.</li>\n<li>Becoming <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Incapacitated\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Incapacitated_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Incapacitated_(Condition)\" title=\"Incapacitated (Condition)\">Incapacitated</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Stunned_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(Condition)\" title=\"Stunned (Condition)\">Stunned</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polymorphed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Polymorphed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polymorphed_(Condition)\" title=\"Polymorphed (Condition)\">Polymorphed</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a> ends the spell.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Chains_of_Karsus\"> Condition: Chains of Karsus </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chains_of_Karsus_(Condition)\" title=\"Chains of Karsus (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chains of Karsus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Generic_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chains_of_Karsus_(Condition)\" title=\"Chains of Karsus (Condition)\">Chains of Karsus</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The Netherbrain is too powerful for even the Momentary God's magic - <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Karsus' Compulsion</a> could not dominate it completely.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The spell has instead bound the brain's will in place temporarily. To complete the domination, you must strike it down.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\">Triune Netherstone</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Granted by holding the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Triune_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Triune_Netherstone\" title=\"Triune Netherstone\">Triune Netherstone</a>. This spell may only be cast by a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Flayer\">Mind Flayer</a>.</li>\n<li>This is one of only four 9th Level spells featured in Baldur's Gate 3. The other three are:\n<ul><li><b>Wish</b>, cast by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/26px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/35px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vlaakith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp/18px-Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Vlaakith_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\">Vlaakith</a> at the end of <a href=\"/wiki/Creche_Y%27llek\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creche Y'llek\">Creche Y'llek</a> if the party doubts her power.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Word_Kill\" title=\"Power Word Kill\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/25px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/38px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/50px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Power Word Kill\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp/25px-Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Power_Word_Kill_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Power_Word_Kill\" title=\"Power Word Kill\">Power Word Kill</a>, learned by the <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Urge\">Dark Urge</a> after slaying Orin and accepting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/29px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/39px-Bhaal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bhaal's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp/20px-Bhaal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Bhaal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal\" title=\"Bhaal\">Bhaal's</a> gift. A special variant is cast by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/25px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/38px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/50px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Farslayer of Bhaal Ghislev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png/25px-Portrait_Ghislev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Ghislev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Farslayer of Bhaal Ghislev</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Withers#Services\" title=\"Withers\">True Resurrection</a> cast by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> when requesting the return of a fallen companion or via the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_True_Resurrection\" title=\"Scroll of True Resurrection\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Scroll_of_Revivify_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_True_Resurrection\" title=\"Scroll of True Resurrection\">Scroll of True Resurrection</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Unlike <b>Wish</b>, Power Word Kill, and True Resurrection, <b>Karsus' Compulsion</b> was created specifically for Baldur's Gate 3.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035833\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.132 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.141 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6573/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 92900/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 42455/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 7/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 36/1000\nLua time usage: 0.036/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1648455/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n102.14%  120.986     76 Template:Trim\n100.00%  118.448      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%  118.448      1 -total\n 18.25%   21.615      4 Template:Item_icon\n 17.55%   20.782      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 17.35%   20.549      5 Template:Cond\n 16.78%   19.873      1 Template:Prereq\n 15.71%   18.607     13 Template:Icon_text\n 14.97%   17.734     12 Template:Icon_link\n 10.97%   12.997      2 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:14474-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715035833 and revision id 360163. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}